# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client (Expo) environment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Create a project at https://supabase.com, then copy these from
# Project Settings > API. These are public (anon) values that are
# safe to bundle in a client app because RLS policies protect data.
#
# Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is embedded in the shipped JS bundle and is
# readable by anyone with the app — never put a secret here. Server-side
# secrets for the affiliate Edge Functions are listed at the bottom of this
# file and are set with `supabase secrets set`, NOT here.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server (Supabase Edge Functions) — DO NOT put these in this file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Listed here only as a checklist. Set them with:
#   supabase secrets set AFFILIATE_POSTBACK_SECRET=...
# and see supabase/functions/README.md for the full deploy procedure.
#
#   AFFILIATE_POSTBACK_SECRET
#       Required by the affiliate-postback function. Shared HMAC secret used
#       to sign conversion postbacks. Generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`.
#       This is the key that decides whether a claimed sale is real, so
#       treat it like a payment credential.
#
#   AFFILIATE_POSTBACK_SECRET_{DIRECT,RAKUTEN,CJ,IMPACT,SHOPSTYLE,AWIN}
#       Optional per-network overrides. Falls back to the value above.
#       Prefer per-network secrets once there is more than one partner, so
#       rotating one network's key doesn't break every other integration.
#
#   CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS
#       Optional, comma-separated. Only needed if Selv is served over Expo
#       Web; native React Native does not enforce CORS.
#
#   SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#       Injected automatically in deployed Edge Functions. Only needed in a
#       local supabase/.env when running `supabase functions serve`.
